{"data": [{"author_id": "1029534461858340864", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:57:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118508075732898203"], "id": "2118508075732898203", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118495232266584335", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan @poteto @yetone 验证标准真得写清楚才行", "url": "https://x.com/TrainCodeMan/status/2118508075732898203"}, {"author_id": "1804406405262381056", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:43:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118504398317895681"], "id": "2118504398317895681", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118495232266584335", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan @poteto @yetone 晓辉博士", "url": "https://x.com/jiehuiliu311067/status/2118504398317895681"}, {"author_id": "1988851885118484480", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:34:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118502134350291031"], "id": "2118502134350291031", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118495232266584335", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan @poteto @yetone 先写验证这点我是真认同，没有验收标准，Agent 改得再多也是自说自话。我现在也是先把检查项钉死再让它跑，录音转写那类活最吃这套，专有名词一错全露馅。", "url": "https://x.com/taiyanghere/status/2118502134350291031"}, {"author_id": "564584308", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:28:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118500833939910717"], "id": "2118500833939910717", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118495232266584335", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan @poteto @yetone 先验证再让 agent 改自己。没有可回放的 acceptance check，自迭代只是在叠黑箱风险。", "url": "https://x.com/bighead_datou/status/2118500833939910717"}, {"author_id": "2030265052360765440", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:21:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118498849979601313"], "id": "2118498849979601313", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118496773706797338", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan 回归样例里可以专门留几条“看起来完成了”的失败：文件生成了，但内容为空；检查通过了，但查的是旧版本。改完 Skill 后，这些例子仍应被判失败，免得迭代的是通过率，漏掉的错误反而更多。", "url": "https://x.com/ChenChaim42853/status/2118498849979601313"}, {"author_id": "2103134962627293185", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:20:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118498822859219065"], "id": "2118498822859219065", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118495232266584335", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan @poteto @yetone 先写验证这点我太有共鸣了，我每天跑生图提示词也是这个路子：先定好这张图要达到什么标准，颜色、光线、构图一项项对着看，不行就改提示词再跑。没有检查标准，迭代就是瞎忙，这期我晚点认真看完～", "url": "https://x.com/xiaoyunHK/status/2118498822859219065"}, {"author_id": "2113983440865660928", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:20:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118498699592802697"], "id": "2118498699592802697", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118496773706797338", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan 小辉博士完全现在设计维度去领导Ai，而不是被Ai带着走", "url": "https://x.com/fxs_daily/status/2118498699592802697"}, {"author_id": "2113983440865660928", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:19:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118498367466885390"], "id": "2118498367466885390", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118496773706797338", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan 在厉害的Ai也写不出这种帖子吧", "url": "https://x.com/fxs_daily/status/2118498367466885390"}, {"author_id": "2113983440865660928", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:17:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118498088633672041"], "id": "2118498088633672041", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118495232266584335", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan @poteto @yetone 我现在按你的方法已经形成了一个闭环，让自己的主题思想跟好的落地，甚至可以进行额外的优化", "url": "https://x.com/fxs_daily/status/2118498088633672041"}, {"author_id": "1637638120173879296", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:17:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497909159383390"], "id": "2118497909159383390", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118495232266584335", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan @poteto @yetone 转写对不对 专有名词一搜全露馅", "url": "https://x.com/winston13111/status/2118497909159383390"}, {"author_id": "306798893", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:17:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497883716522312"], "id": "2118497883716522312", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118495232266584335", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan @poteto @yetone 这个问题我在交付里也碰到过。判断 Agent 做没做对，靠的是一组能跑的验收用例，而不是它自己说“已完成”。用例先写，Agent 再改，改完用例过不过，才是证据。", "url": "https://x.com/cccdick/status/2118497883716522312"}, {"author_id": "1089049411831779328", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:14:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497337916239924"], "id": "2118497337916239924", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118495232266584335", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan @poteto @yetone 录音转写那个，后来主要加了哪些检查项？", "url": "https://x.com/WenBuilds/status/2118497337916239924"}, {"author_id": "18405001", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:14:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497202750538194"], "id": "2118497202750538194", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118495232266584335", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan @poteto @yetone 循环之前先写验证，这个顺序我觉得比直接让它自己迭代重要多了。标准要是写在外面，它喊做完了你才有地方对得上，不然改来改去也不知道哪次算对", "url": "https://x.com/wzperson/status/2118497202750538194"}, {"author_id": "2042551384206172160", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:12:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118496829214232702"], "id": "2118496829214232702", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 98, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118495232266584335", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xiaohuiyuan @poteto @yetone 验证其实是Agent自我迭代里最容易被低估的一环：没有可度量的验收标准，loop转再多也只是在放大噪声。把评测和规则先写清楚，迭代的速度和方向感都会明显不一样。", "url": "https://x.com/ip_ao88339/status/2118496829214232702"}, {"author_id": "1323768907", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:12:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118496773706797338"], "id": "2118496773706797338", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323768907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 915, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118495232266584335", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Skill 自迭代能力改造指南\n\n【使用方式】\n将本指南完整复制给能够访问、编辑你的 Skill 文件的 Agent（如 Claude Code、Codex），并告诉它需要改造的 Skill 路径。\nAgent 应先阅读现有文件并提供简要诊断，再与用户确认标准，最后实施改造。\n\n【改造目标】\n请帮我检查并改造现有 Skill，让它从一份依赖", "url": "https://x.com/xiaohuiyuan/status/2118496773706797338"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1029534461858340864", "name": "Code Trainer | 代码训练师", "username": "TrainCodeMan"}, {"id": "1804406405262381056", "name": "jiehui liu", "username": "jiehuiliu311067"}, {"id": "1988851885118484480", "name": "太阳", "username": "taiyanghere"}, {"id": "564584308", "name": "Big Head(大头版)", "username": "bighead_datou"}, {"id": "2030265052360765440", "name": "chaim chen", "username": "ChenChaim42853"}, {"id": "2103134962627293185", "name": "晓云 AI 日记", "username": "xiaoyunHK"}, {"id": "2113983440865660928", "name": "FXS", "username": "fxs_daily"}, {"id": "1637638120173879296", "name": "Winston", "username": "winston13111"}, {"id": "306798893", "name": "Vibe Coder 44", "username": "cccdick"}, {"id": "1089049411831779328", "name": "WenWen", "username": "WenBuilds"}, {"id": "18405001", "name": "Raymond Wang｜用AI做出海App", "username": "wzperson"}, {"id": "2042551384206172160", "name": "硅基观测站", "username": "ip_ao88339"}, {"id": "1323768907", "name": "晓辉博士", "username": "xiaohuiyuan"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2118508075732898203", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyxj9be2k76jtc4uz6m9xolehz1", "oldest_id": "2118496773706797338", "result_count": 15}}